<title>USA: Applied Computer sees stronger market.</title>
<headline>Applied Computer sees stronger market.</headline>
<dateline>FORT COLLINS, Colo. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Computer Technology Inc said Monday it was disappointed with hardware sales in the 1996 fourth quarter but expects a stronger market in the 1997 first half.</p>
<p>The company said it is encouraged by recent trends, particularly in the demand for its higher-margin professional services.</p>
</text>
